!!! archon/model/severity.mat
!!! Risk severity for an Archon finding.
!!!
!!! Severity is ordinal: a higher rank means a more serious issue. It is
!!! deliberately separate from confidence, because a certain low-severity issue
!!! and a speculative critical one must stay distinguishable in a report.

book archon.model.severity

read everything from ny.lang.core

public severity begin choice
    when Info
    when Low
    when Medium
    when High
    when Critical
end choice

!!! Ordinal rank; higher means more severe.
public severity-rank receives level as severity returns number begin paragraph
    value rank as number is consider level
        when severity.Info give 0
        when severity.Low give 1
        when severity.Medium give 2
        when severity.High give 3
        when severity.Critical give 4
        otherwise give 0
    end consider
    give rank
end paragraph

!!! A stable, lower-case name for machine-readable output.
public severity-name receives level as severity returns text begin paragraph
    value name as text is consider level
        when severity.Info give "info"
        when severity.Low give "low"
        when severity.Medium give "medium"
        when severity.High give "high"
        when severity.Critical give "critical"
        otherwise give "info"
    end consider
    give name
end paragraph
